          "content": {
            "size": 49098,
            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "text": "/*\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n *  OUTLOOK INBOX READER — Styles\n *  Dark blue aesthetic, matching that dongvanfb vibe.\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n */\n\n/* ─── Reset & Base ─────────────────────────────────────────── */\n*, *::before, *::after {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n:root {\n    /* Core field — ink-black gallery base (nk.studio Minimal Spark) */\n    --bg-deep:      #070b0a;\n    --bg-surface:   #0a0f0e;\n    --bg-card:      #0c1211;\n    --bg-elevated:  #121917;\n    --bg-input:     #0a0f0e;\n\n    /* Accents — reserve the neon spark for highlights only */\n    --accent-mint:    #00ffc2;   /* primary spark */\n    --accent-cyan:    #20e7b7;   /* secondary aqua-mint */\n    --accent-green:   #00ffc2;\n    --accent-teal:    #20e7b7;\n    --accent-orange:  #ffb454;\n    --accent-red:     #ff5a6a;\n    --accent-purple:  #b388ff;\n\n    /* Text — soft warm white */\n    --text-primary:   #fdfdf9;\n    --text-secondary: #a7b0ac;\n    --text-muted:     #6f7a76;\n\n    /* Borders — thin and quiet; depth comes from contrast, not shadow */\n    --border-subtle:  rgba(253, 253, 249, 0.10);\n    --border-accent:  rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.30);\n\n    /* Gradients kept minimal (spec: avoid heavy gradients) */\n    --grad-primary:   linear-gradient(90deg, #00ffc2, #20e7b7);\n    --grad-card:      linear-gradient(0deg, #0c1211, #0c1211);\n    --grad-header:    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7, 11, 10, 0.85), rgba(7, 11, 10, 0.72));\n\n    /* Elevation is flat — no shadow stacks, only a faint spark glow */\n    --shadow-sm:      none;\n    --shadow-md:      none;\n    --shadow-lg:      none;\n    --shadow-glow:    0 0 32px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.10);\n\n    /* Typography */\n    --font-display:   'DM Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n\n    /* Softly geometric — 4/7/8/12; pills reserved for chips */\n    --radius-sm: 4px;\n    --radius-md: 7px;\n    --radius-lg: 8px;\n    --radius-pill: 9999px;\n    --transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n}\n\nhtml {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}\n\nbody {\n    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n    background: var(--bg-deep);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n/* Subtle background pattern */\nbody::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 50%, rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.03) 0%, transparent 60%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.03) 0%, transparent 60%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 0;\n}\n\n/* ─── HEADER ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.header {\n    background: var(--grad-header);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    padding: 0 2rem;\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 100;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n}\n\n.header-inner {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    height: 64px;\n}\n\n.brand {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.brand-icon {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes float {\n    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }\n    50% { transform: translateY(-3px); }\n}\n\n.brand-name {\n    font-size: 1.35rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.brand-accent {\n    background: var(--grad-primary);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    background-clip: text;\n}\n\n.nav-links {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    transition: var(--transition);\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover {\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n}\n\n.nav-link.active {\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.08);\n}\n\n/* ─── MAIN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.main {\n    flex: 1;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n}\n\n/* ─── SECTION LABEL ────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.section-label {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: var(--accent-green);\n    color: #05100d;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.2);\n}\n\n.section-label-icon {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* ─── CARD ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.card {\n    background: var(--grad-card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n}\n\n.card:hover {\n    border-color: var(--border-accent);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md), var(--shadow-glow);\n}\n\n.card-header {\n    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.card-title {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card-title-text {\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n/* ─── MODE TOGGLES ─────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.mode-toggles {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.toggle-label {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: inline-flex;\n}\n\n.toggle-input {\n    display: none;\n}\n\n.toggle-pill {\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n    user-select: none;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n}\n\n.graph-pill {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.1);\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.2);\n}\n\n.graph-pill.active {\n    background: var(--accent-cyan);\n    color: #05100d;\n    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.3);\n}\n\n.oauth2-pill {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.1);\n    color: var(--accent-green);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.2);\n}\n\n.oauth2-pill.active {\n    background: var(--accent-green);\n    color: #05100d;\n    border-color: var(--accent-green);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* ─── CARD BODY ────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.card-body {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.credentials-textarea {\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 200px;\n    max-height: 400px;\n    background: var(--bg-input);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 1rem;\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', 'Consolas', monospace;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    resize: vertical;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n    outline: none;\n}\n\n.credentials-textarea::placeholder {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-style: italic;\n}\n\n.credentials-textarea:focus {\n    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.1);\n}\n\n.card-actions {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.input-stats {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.stat-badge {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n/* ─── BUTTONS ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 10px 24px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n    outline: none;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: var(--accent-green);\n    color: #05100d;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.25);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n    background: #00c96a;\n    transform: translateY(-1px);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.35);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:active {\n    transform: translateY(0);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:disabled {\n    opacity: 0.6;\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    transform: none;\n}\n\n.btn-icon {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n}\n\n/* Spinner */\n.spinner {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(11, 26, 46, 0.3);\n    border-top-color: #0b1a2e;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    animation: spin 0.7s linear infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes spin {\n    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n}\n\n/* ─── STATUS BAR ───────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.status-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    padding: 12px 18px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    margin-top: 1.25rem;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    animation: slideUp 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.status-bar.success {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.2);\n    color: var(--accent-green);\n}\n\n.status-bar.error {\n    background: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.2);\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n}\n\n.status-bar.loading {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.2);\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n@keyframes slideUp {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n/* ─── RESULTS AREA ─────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.results-area {\n    margin-top: 1.5rem;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n/* Account result block */\n.account-result {\n    background: var(--grad-card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease;\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n.account-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.account-email {\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.account-email .email-icon {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n}\n\n.account-status {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n}\n\n.account-status.ok {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.15);\n    color: var(--accent-green);\n}\n\n.account-status.fail {\n    background: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.15);\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n}\n\n.account-error {\n    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n/* ─── INBOX TABLE (dongvanfb style) ────────────────────────── */\n.inbox-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n.inbox-table thead {\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n}\n\n.inbox-table th {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.inbox-table td {\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    vertical-align: top;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.inbox-table tbody tr {\n    transition: var(--transition);\n}\n\n.inbox-table tbody tr:hover {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.04);\n}\n\n.inbox-table tbody tr:last-child td {\n    border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n/* Column widths */\n.col-mail { min-width: 160px; }\n.col-stt { width: 50px; text-align: center; }\n.col-from { min-width: 150px; }\n.col-time { width: 140px; white-space: nowrap; }\n.col-content { min-width: 250px; }\n.col-code { width: 80px; text-align: center; }\n\n/* Mail column */\n.mail-icon {\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n\n.mail-icon.unread {\n    filter: brightness(1.5);\n}\n\n.mail-address {\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n/* From column */\n.col-from small {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Content column */\n.col-content strong {\n    color: var(--accent-teal);\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.detail-link {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n    color: var(--accent-green);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n}\n\n.detail-link:hover {\n    color: #00ffc2;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n/* Code badge */\n.code-badge {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.15);\n    color: var(--accent-green);\n    padding: 3px 10px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n/* Empty row */\n.empty-row {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2rem !important;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-style: italic;\n}\n\n/* Table scroll on mobile */\n.account-result {\n    overflow-x: auto;\n}\n\n/* ─── MODAL ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.modal-overlay {\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    z-index: 1000;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 2rem;\n    animation: fadeInFast 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeInFast {\n    from { opacity: 0; }\n    to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n.modal {\n    background: var(--bg-card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    max-height: 80vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    animation: modalSlide 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n}\n\n@keyframes modalSlide {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95) translateY(10px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }\n}\n\n.modal-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.modal-title {\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--accent-teal);\n    line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.modal-close {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.modal-close:hover {\n    background: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.15);\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    border-color: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.3);\n}\n\n.modal-meta {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n.modal-from {\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.modal-date {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.modal-body {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 0.88rem;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.modal-body img {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n}\n\n.modal-body a {\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n/* ─── FOOTER ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    margin-top: auto;\n}\n\n/* ─── SCROLLBAR ────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    width: 6px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n    background: transparent;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n}\n\n/* ─── RESPONSIVE ───────────────────────────────────────────── */\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .header-inner {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        height: auto;\n        padding: 0.75rem 0;\n        gap: 0.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .card-title {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    .card-actions {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 0.75rem;\n        align-items: stretch;\n    }\n\n    .btn-primary {\n        justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .email-top-row {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .modal {\n        max-height: 90vh;\n    }\n}\n\n/* ─── APP SECTIONS ───────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.app-section {\n    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease forwards;\n}\n\n/* ─── AUTO FORMAT TAB ──────────────────────────────────────── */\n.format-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n\n.format-title {\n    font-size: 1.8rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.format-icon {\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.format-subtitle {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.format-badges {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.badge {\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.badge-cyan {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.15);\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* Dropzone */\n.dropzone {\n    position: relative;\n    border: 2px dashed rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.4);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n    padding: 3rem 2rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n\n.dropzone:hover, .dropzone.dragover {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.05);\n    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.file-input-hidden {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.dropzone-content {\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.folder-icon {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.dropzone-content h3 {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.dropzone-content p {\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n/* Stat Cards */\n.format-stats {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n\n.stat-card {\n    background: var(--bg-card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 8px;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.stat-val {\n    font-size: 1.8rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n}\n\n.val-cyan { color: var(--accent-cyan); }\n.val-green { color: var(--accent-green); }\n.val-red { color: var(--accent-red); }\n\n.stat-lbl {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n/* Output Area */\n.format-output-area {\n    background: var(--bg-card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    animation: slideUp 0.3s ease forwards;\n}\n\n.output-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.output-actions {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.btn-sm {\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n.format-textarea {\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 0;\n    height: 300px;\n    resize: vertical;\n}\n.format-textarea:focus {\n    box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n/* ─── CHECK MAIL TAB ─────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.check-results-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 1rem;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.check-box {\n    background: var(--bg-card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.check-box-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.check-box-title {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.check-count {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n/* Colors for specific boxes */\n.live-box { border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-green); }\n.live-box .check-box-title { color: var(--accent-green); }\n.live-box .check-count { background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.15); }\n\n.die-box { border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-red); }\n.die-box .check-box-title { color: var(--accent-red); }\n.die-box .check-count { background: rgba(255, 90, 106, 0.15); }\n\n.error-box { border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan); }\n.error-box .check-box-title { color: var(--accent-cyan); }\n.error-box .check-count { background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.15); }\n\n.check-textarea {\n    flex-grow: 1;\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    padding: 1rem;\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    resize: none;\n    min-height: 300px;\n}\n.check-textarea:focus {\n    outline: none;\n}\n\n/* ─── PROXY SETTINGS ─────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.proxy-settings {\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.proxy-settings summary {\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    user-select: none;\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.proxy-settings summary:hover {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.proxy-textarea {\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 80px;\n    height: 100px;\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    resize: vertical;\n}\n\n.proxy-textarea:focus {\n    outline: none;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n/* ─── UTILITY ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.hidden { display: none !important; }\n\n/* ─── RESPONSIVE DESIGN (MOBILE) ───────────────────────────── */\n@media (max-width: 992px) {\n    .check-results-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .header {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        gap: 1rem;\n        padding: 1rem;\n    }\n    \n    .nav-links {\n        width: 100%;\n        overflow-x: auto;\n        padding-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    }\n    \n    .nav-link {\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .card-header, .card-actions, .card-footer {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: stretch;\n        gap: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .mode-toggles, .auto-refresh-controls, .action-buttons {\n        width: 100%;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    .btn {\n        width: 100%;\n        justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .result-item {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        gap: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .result-status {\n        align-self: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    .email-subject {\n        max-width: 100%;\n        white-space: normal;\n    }\n    \n    .stats-container {\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n}\n\n/* ─── AUTO REFRESH CONTROLS ────────────────────────────────── */\n.auto-refresh-controls {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-toggle {\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 20px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-toggle input {\n    opacity: 0;\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-slider {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-slider::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    top: 2px;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    background: var(--text-secondary);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-toggle input:checked + .auto-refresh-slider {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.2);\n    border-color: var(--accent-green);\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-toggle input:checked + .auto-refresh-slider::before {\n    transform: translateX(16px);\n    background: var(--accent-green);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.4);\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-label {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-select {\n    background: var(--bg-input);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-select:focus {\n    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.auto-refresh-countdown {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n    min-width: 28px;\n    text-align: center;\n    animation: pulse 1s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes pulse {\n    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n    50% { opacity: 0.5; }\n}\n\n/* ─── ACTION BUTTONS ───────────────────────────────────────── */\n.action-buttons {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.btn-secondary {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.12);\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.25);\n}\n\n.btn-secondary:hover {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.2);\n    transform: translateY(-1px);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.15);\n}\n\n.btn-secondary:disabled {\n    opacity: 0.6;\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    transform: none;\n}\n\n.btn-secondary .spinner {\n    border: 2px solid rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.3);\n    border-top-color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n/* ─── COPY CODE BUTTON ─────────────────────────────────────── */\n.code-cell {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.copy-code-btn {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.2);\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.copy-code-btn:hover {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.2);\n    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.copy-code-btn.copied {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.15);\n    border-color: var(--accent-green);\n    color: var(--accent-green);\n}\n\n/* ─── TOAST NOTIFICATIONS ──────────────────────────────────── */\n.toast-container {\n    position: fixed;\n    bottom: 24px;\n    right: 24px;\n    z-index: 2000;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.toast {\n    background: var(--bg-elevated);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    animation: toastIn 0.3s ease, toastOut 0.3s ease 2.2s forwards;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.toast.success {\n    border-color: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.3);\n}\n\n@keyframes toastIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }\n}\n\n@keyframes toastOut {\n    from { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }\n    to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px); }\n}\n\n/* ─── CHECK MAIL RESULTS ───────────────────────────────────── */\n.check-results-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n.check-results-table thead {\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n}\n\n.check-results-table th {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.check-results-table td {\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.check-results-table tbody tr:last-child td {\n    border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.live-badge {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    padding: 3px 12px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n}\n\n.live-badge.live {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.15);\n    color: var(--accent-green);\n}\n\n.live-badge.dead {\n    background: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.15);\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n}\n\n.response-time {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n}\n\n/* ─── Section Description ──────────────────────────────────── */\n.section-desc {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem 0;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.04);\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan);\n    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n}\n\n.section-desc code {\n    background: rgba(32, 231, 183, 0.12);\n    color: var(--accent-cyan);\n    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n}\n\n/*\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n *  TIDY-UP — moves scattered inline styles into the design system\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n */\n\n/* ─── Card footer + line count (Check Mail) ───────────────────── */\n.card-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.line-count {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n/* ─── About tab ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.about-card {\n    max-width: 620px;\n    margin: 2rem auto;\n    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.about-title {\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.about-text {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.about-badge {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--accent-mint);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-accent);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n/* Feature list — explains what the tool does */\n.about-features {\n    list-style: none;\n    text-align: left;\n    margin: 1.75rem 0 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.about-features li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 0.9rem;\n    padding: 0.9rem 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.about-features li:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.feat-icon {\n    font-size: 1.15rem;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n}\n\n.feat-text {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n.feat-text strong {\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n\n.feat-text span {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Contact */\n.about-contact {\n    margin-top: 2rem;\n    padding-top: 1.75rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.contact-label {\n    display: block;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n.contact-link {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--accent-mint);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    color: var(--accent-mint);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n}\n\n.contact-link:hover {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.10);\n}\n\n.tg-icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/*\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n *  NK.STUDIO — Minimal Spark\n *  Ink-black gallery field · warm-white type · neon spark used sparingly\n *  DM Sans everywhere · flat depth (borders, not shadows) · 4–8px radii\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n */\n\nhtml { font-size: 16px; }\n\nbody { font-family: 'DM Sans', 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; }\n\n/* Quiet, gallery-like field — a single faint spark of glow, nothing heavy */\nbody::before {\n    background:\n        radial-gradient(46% 40% at 84% -8%, rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.06) 0%, transparent 62%);\n}\n\n::selection { background: var(--accent-mint); color: #05100d; }\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(253, 253, 249, 0.14); }\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.30); }\n\n/* ─── Type — DM Sans, light headlines, tight tracking ─────────── */\n.brand-name,\n.format-title,\n.card-title-text,\n.modal-title,\n.about-title,\n.about-panel-title,\n.dropzone-content h3 {\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n}\n\n.brand-name { font-size: 1.45rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }\n\n.format-title {\n    font-size: 2.4rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n}\n\n.format-subtitle { font-size: 1.05rem; }\n\n/* ─── Airier canvas ───────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.main { padding: 3rem 2rem 4rem; }\n.section-desc { font-size: 0.95rem; }\n\n/* ─── Header — flat glass, animated mint underline on nav ─────── */\n.header {\n    background: var(--grad-header);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(130%);\n}\n\n.header-inner { height: 72px; }\n\n.nav-link { position: relative; }\n\n.nav-link::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 1rem;\n    right: 1rem;\n    bottom: 5px;\n    height: 2px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    background: var(--accent-mint);\n    transform: scaleX(0);\n    transform-origin: left;\n    transition: transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover::after,\n.nav-link.active::after { transform: scaleX(1); }\n\n.nav-link.active {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent-mint);\n}\n\n/* ─── Section label → quiet overline chip ─────────────────────── */\n.section-label {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent-mint);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-accent);\n    box-shadow: none;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n}\n\n/* ─── Cards — clean flat containers, not raised panels ────────── */\n.card,\n.account-result,\n.format-output-area,\n.stat-card,\n.check-box {\n    background: var(--bg-card);\n    box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n.card:hover {\n    transform: none;\n    border-color: var(--border-accent);\n    box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n/* ─── Buttons — text-first, 7px, no pills, spark used as accent ── */\n.btn {\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 12px 22px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent-mint);\n    border: 1px solid var(--accent-mint);\n    box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.10);\n    box-shadow: none;\n    transform: none;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:active { transform: none; }\n\n.btn-secondary {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.btn-secondary:hover {\n    background: rgba(253, 253, 249, 0.06);\n    border-color: var(--border-accent);\n    box-shadow: none;\n    transform: none;\n}\n\n/* Spinner must stay visible on the now-transparent buttons */\n.spinner,\n.btn-secondary .spinner {\n    border: 2px solid rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.28);\n    border-top-color: var(--accent-mint);\n}\n\n/* ─── Inputs — light-touch, mint focus, no heavy outline ──────── */\n.credentials-textarea:focus,\n.proxy-textarea:focus {\n    border-color: var(--accent-mint);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.12);\n}\n\n/* ─── Motion — the per-element cascade lives in the MOTION block below ── */\n\n/* ─── Mobile ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .main { padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem; }\n    .format-title { font-size: 1.9rem; }\n    .header-inner { height: auto; }\n}\n\n/*\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n *  MOTION — spark-forward but tasteful · honours prefers-reduced-motion\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n\n    /* Ambient — the mint spark slowly drifts and breathes */\n    body::before {\n        animation: auroraDrift 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n    }\n\n    /* Header eases down on load */\n    .header {\n        animation: slideDown 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;\n    }\n\n    /* Logo wordmark gets a slow light sweep */\n    .brand-accent {\n        background-size: 220% auto;\n        animation: shimmer 5s linear infinite;\n    }\n\n    /* Tab switch — children cascade in one after another */\n    .app-section.active > *,\n    .app-section.active .about-card > * {\n        animation: revealUp 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;\n    }\n    .app-section.active > *:nth-child(1),\n    .app-section.active .about-card > *:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.04s; }\n    .app-section.active > *:nth-child(2),\n    .app-section.active .about-card > *:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.10s; }\n    .app-section.active > *:nth-child(3),\n    .app-section.active .about-card > *:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.16s; }\n    .app-section.active > *:nth-child(4),\n    .app-section.active .about-card > *:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.22s; }\n    .app-section.active > *:nth-child(5),\n    .app-section.active .about-card > *:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.28s; }\n    .app-section.active > *:nth-child(6),\n    .app-section.active .about-card > *:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.34s; }\n    .app-section.active > *:nth-child(n+7),\n    .app-section.active .about-card > *:nth-child(n+7) { animation-delay: 0.40s; }\n\n    /* Buttons — a light sweep glides across on hover */\n    .btn > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n    .btn::after {\n        content: '';\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        left: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 100%;\n        background: linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 35%, rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.22) 50%, transparent 65%);\n        transform: translateX(-130%);\n        transition: transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n        pointer-events: none;\n    }\n    .btn:hover::after { transform: translateX(130%); }\n\n    /* Cards settle into a soft mint glow on hover */\n    .card { transition: var(--transition), box-shadow 0.35s ease; }\n    .card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow); }\n}\n\n@keyframes auroraDrift {\n    from { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale(1); }\n    to   { transform: translate3d(-4%, 3%, 0) scale(1.18); }\n}\n\n@keyframes slideDown {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-100%); }\n    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n@keyframes shimmer {\n    to { background-position: 220% center; }\n}\n\n@keyframes revealUp {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }\n    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n/*\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n *  ADVANCED MOTION — intro curtain · scroll reveal · custom cursor\n *  Driven by animations.js; JS only wires these when the device has a\n *  fine pointer and the user hasn't asked to reduce motion.\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n */\n\n/* ─── Intro curtain (once per session) ────────────────────────── */\n.intro-curtain {\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    z-index: 9999;\n    background: var(--bg-deep);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    will-change: transform;\n}\n\n.intro-mark {\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 2.6rem);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    opacity: 0;\n    animation: introMarkIn 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n.intro-mark span {\n    color: var(--accent-mint);\n    margin-left: 0.4rem;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.45);\n}\n\n.intro-curtain.intro-exit {\n    animation: curtainUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.7, 0, 0.2, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n@keyframes introMarkIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px) scale(0.98); }\n    to   { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n}\n\n@keyframes curtainUp {\n    from { transform: translateY(0); }\n    to   { transform: translateY(-100%); }\n}\n\n/* ─── Scroll reveal for injected inbox results ────────────────── */\n.reveal-on-scroll {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(26px);\n    transition: opacity 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),\n                transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n    will-change: opacity, transform;\n}\n\n.reveal-on-scroll.is-revealed {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: none;\n}\n\n/* ─── Custom cursor (mint dot + trailing glow ring) ───────────── */\n.has-cursor,\n.has-cursor * { cursor: none !important; }\n\n.has-cursor textarea { cursor: text !important; }\n\n.cursor-dot,\n.cursor-ring {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    z-index: 10000;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.has-cursor.cursor-active .cursor-dot,\n.has-cursor.cursor-active .cursor-ring { opacity: 1; }\n\n.cursor-dot {\n    width: 7px;\n    height: 7px;\n    background: var(--accent-mint);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.8);\n}\n\n.cursor-ring {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.5);\n    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, width 0.2s ease, height 0.2s ease,\n                background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.has-cursor.cursor-hover .cursor-ring {\n    width: 52px;\n    height: 52px;\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.08);\n    border-color: var(--accent-mint);\n}\n\n/*\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n *  API TAB — Telegram-bot key issuance + quick start\n * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n */\n.api-quickstart-desc {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.api-quickstart-desc code {\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 194, 0.12);\n    color: var(--accent-mint);\n    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n}\n\n.code-block {\n    background: var(--bg-input);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', 'Consolas', monospace;\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    white-space: pre;\n}\n\n"
          },
